   "subject": "Re: R function dir.exists in rstan",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">We had a call to dir.exists() in rstanarm but I changed it to file.exists(), which served the same purpose and would work for R &gt;= 3.0.2. We should do the same for the remaining two in rstan<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000000;background-color:#ffffff\"><span style=\"color:#000\">goodrich@T540p</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#080\">/opt/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan$ git grep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">F </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">n </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;dir.exists&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">|</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cat  </span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><div><span style=\"font-family:monospace\"><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">131</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">exists</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan_options</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;boost_lib&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">R</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#066\">138</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(!</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dir</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">exists</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rstan_options</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;eigen_lib&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></span></div></div></code></div><br>Ben</div>"
